{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q421052","formula":"C₅₃H₈₃NO₁₄","hill":"C53H83NO14","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":53.0,"H":83.0,"N":1.0,"O":14.0},"names":{"en":"Everolimus","ru":"Эверолимус","uk":"Еверолімус"},"descriptions":{"en":"Everolimus, sold under the brand name Afinitor among others, is a medication used as an immunosuppressant to prevent rejection of organ transplants and as a targeted therapy in the treatment of renal cell cancer and other tumours. This compound also has a use in cardiovascular drug-eluting stent technologies to inhibit restenosis. It is the 40-O-(2-hydroxyethyl) derivative of sirolimus and works similarly to sirolimus as an inhibitor of mammalian target of rapamycin (mTOR).","ru":"Эверолимус — является производным сиролимуса (рапамицина) и имеет такой же механизм действия как и сиролимус, обладает иммуносупрессивным и противоопухолевым действием, является ингибитором mTOR.","uk":"Еверолімус (англ. Everolimus, лат. Everolimusum) — напівсинтетичний лікарський препарат, який за своєю хімічною структурою є похідним сиролімусу та має макролідну структуру."},"fame":27,"pubchemCid":6442177,"mass":958.2,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@@H]1CC[C@H]2C[C@@H](/C(=C/C=C/C=C/[C@H](C[C@H](C(=O)[C@@H]([C@@H](/C(=C/[C@H](C(=O)C[C@H](OC(=O)[C@@H]3CCCCN3C(=O)C(=O)[C@@]1(O2)O)[C@H](C)C[C@@H]4CC[C@H]([C@@H](C4)OC)OCCO)C)/C)O)OC)C)C)/C)OC","inchikey":"HKVAMNSJSFKALM-GKUWKFKPSA-N","iupac":"(1R,9S,12S,15R,16E,18R,19R,21R,23S,24E,26E,28E,30S,32S,35R)-1,18-dihydroxy-12-[(2R)-1-[(1S,3R,4R)-4-(2-hydroxyethoxy)-3-methoxycyclohexyl]propan-2-yl]-19,30-dimethoxy-15,17,21,23,29,35-hexamethyl-11,36-dioxa-4-azatricyclo[30.3.1.04,9]hexatriaconta-16,24,26,28-tetraene-2,3,10,14,20-pentone","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"6442177","atoms":151,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},